# /enhance-me — Prompt Enhancer Router

**Read and follow `.cursor/skills/enhance-me/SKILL.md` immediately.**

When the user says "/enhance-me", "enhance-me", or includes `/enhance-me` anywhere in their message:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/enhance-me/SKILL.md` (or `~/.cursor/skills/enhance-me/SKILL.md`)
2. Follow the mandatory protocol exactly: extract task → route model → launch Task subagent → display enhanced prompt → execute it
3. Do NOT respond conversationally without launching the subagent — that is a protocol violation
